  unitName: Commander Mega
  unitId: 20124
  unitNumber: 158
  description: Master Commander of the ruined Sama Kingdom's navy. He first took
    his job as admiral as a joke, but after learning he was descended from the previous
    admiral began showing his true fortitude. He took on the gods, liberating the
    seas, all whilst rebuilding a corrupt navy. For his merits he received the treasured
    axe Poseidon.
  summonDesc: You, summoned me!?<br>Guess now there's little left<br>but for you
    to meet the Sea God.
  fusionDesc: Is there a limit to my power?<br>How should I know?!
  evoDesc: Poseidon shakes with joy...<br>What a great time we'll surely have together!
